WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:03.050
(wine pouring)

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.740
- I wanna sing a little ditty

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.910
for my sweet, very short friend, Rebecca,

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.630
who is turning 22 tomorrow,

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:12.500
wink, wink!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.333
(laughing)

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:14.270
I'm gonna give you something

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.150
you ain't never had before.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.263
- Yes!

00:00:17.263 --> 00:00:20.346
(gentle piano music)

00:00:23.246 --> 00:00:25.618
- Close your eyes ...

00:00:25.618 --> 00:00:29.600
- [Crowd] Oh!

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.433
- I'm cool.

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:31.266
- Yay!

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.100
- It's an amazing day in wine country.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.930
- When was the last time
we were all together?

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:36.763
- [Rebecca] I just want this

00:00:36.763 --> 00:00:38.350
to feel like a regular vacation,

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.330
and somewhere in there
I'll just slide into 50.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.430
- [All] To Rebecca!

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.800
- Age is just a number.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.440
What would you say your soul's age is?

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.490
- Eighteen.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:49.660
Old enough to drink and bone.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.476
Don't have my own car yet,

00:00:51.476 --> 00:00:52.835
but I have a bike.

00:00:52.835 --> 00:00:53.668
(bell ringing)

00:00:53.668 --> 00:00:55.620
- I made itineraries of
everything we're gonna do

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.280
minute by minute on the trip.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.299
We have lavender popping corn.

00:01:00.299 --> 00:01:01.785
- That's not enough.

00:01:01.785 --> 00:01:02.618
- Oh my god.

00:01:02.618 --> 00:01:03.889
- We wanna keep this party goin'!

00:01:03.889 --> 00:01:05.206
- [Rebecca] What is that?

00:01:05.206 --> 00:01:06.114
- Molly.

00:01:06.114 --> 00:01:06.947
(gasps)

00:01:06.947 --> 00:01:07.780
- I did Molly in college,

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.431
but she went back to her boyfriend.

00:01:09.431 --> 00:01:11.070
- Ayo!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.550
- Celebrating with a girls weekend, huh?

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.500
Just remember guys, whatever gets said,

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.220
it's probably what the
person has always felt,

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.832
and the alcohol just let it out.

00:01:18.832 --> 00:01:19.665
(wine pouring)

00:01:19.665 --> 00:01:21.015
(gentle piano music)

00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:22.786
- This weekend is a mess.

00:01:22.786 --> 00:01:23.667
(screaming)

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:24.522
- Something bit me!

00:01:24.522 --> 00:01:26.426
- Oh my God, I'm gonna die!

00:01:26.426 --> 00:01:28.490
- I can't even plan a fun birthday trip.

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:29.980
- If you were just to let go,

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.400
everything will just fall into place.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.535
- Will it fall into place?

00:01:32.535 --> 00:01:35.240
(screams)

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.290
- Do you think throwing the
itineraries out the window

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:38.710
was on the itinerary?

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:39.960
- Guess we'll never know.

00:01:41.052 --> 00:01:46.052
♪ Close your eyes, give
me your hand, darling. ♪

00:01:46.659 --> 00:01:49.270
- If we can't get through
a weekend together,

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:51.091
then I'm completely lost.

00:01:51.091 --> 00:01:53.232
- [All] Do you understand?

00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:56.330
- Just get to the bush and
you're fine from there!

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.410
That's what she said.

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.220
- These women, I have
known for 20 plus years.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.880
And yeah, sometimes I wanna
tell this one to fuck off.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.090
- You want me to fuck off?

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:04.993
- That's what intimacy looks like.

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:07.550
- [All] Day!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.110
- This one's good, what's it called again?

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.313
- White wine.
- Ugh, freakin' love it!

